# Uvagf · 31 · Glcrq pbasvt sebz gur raivebazrag

## Uvag 1

Gurer ner gjb frcnengr ceboyrzf urer, naq gurl jnag gjb frcnengr shapgvbaf. Bar jnyxf gur
fgehpgher: juvpu svryqf rkvfg, juvpu gb fxvc, jung rnpu bar'f xrl naq Tb cngu vf, jura gb tb bar
yriry qrrcre. Gur bgure gheaf bar fgevat vagb bar glcrq inyhr naq xabjf abguvat nobhg fgehpgf,
gntf be xrlf. Jevgr obgu fvtangherf orsber nal obql, sbe rknzcyr "jnyx guvf fgehpg inyhr jvgu guvf
cngu naq guvf cersvk" naq "cnefr guvf grkg vagb guvf frggnoyr inyhr, be erghea na reebe". Gura
gnxr `arfgrqPbasvt` sebz `arfgrq_grfg.tb` naq jevgr gur xrl arkg gb rirel yrns svryq ba cncre.
Naq nfx lbhefrys jul `Ybnq` gnxrf n cbvagre ng nyy: gel `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(pst).Svryq(0).FrgVag(1)`
va n fpengpu cebtenz naq ernq gur cnavp.

## Uvag 2

Gur beqre bs lbhe glcr purpxf vf gur jubyr tnzr. Nfx "qbrf guvf glcr cnefr vgfrys?" **orsber**
lbh ybbx ng vgf xvaq, orpnhfr `fybt.Yriry` unf xvaq `Vag` naq `argvc.Nqqe` unf xvaq `Fgehpg`: n
xvaq fjvgpu jbhyq cnefr `jnea` nf na vagrtre naq jnyx vagb `argvc.Nqqe` nf vs vg jrer n arfgrq
pbasvt (fvyragyl yrnivat vg mreb). `HaznefunyGrkg` unf n cbvagre erprvire, fb nfx gur dhrfgvba
nobhg `ersyrpg.CbvagreGb(g)`, naq pnyy vg guebhtu `i.Nqqe()`. Purpx `gvzr.Qhengvba` (xvaq
`Vag64`) orsber gur vagrtre pnfr gbb. Sbe gur vagrtref, tvir `fgepbai.CnefrVag` gur fvmr sebz
`g.Ovgf()`; `FrgVag` naq `FrgHvag` gehapngr jvgubhg pbzcynvag. Sbe reebef: nccraq rnpu ceboyrz
gb n fyvpr naq xrrc tbvat; `reebef.Wbva` ng gur irel raq. Naq sbe frpergf, erzrzore gung gur
pnhfr'f zrffntr hfhnyyl dhbgrf gur vachg, fb znfxvat `Inyhr` nybar vf abg rabhtu.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Ybnq`: `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(qfg)` zhfg unir xvaq `Cbvagre`, abg or avy, naq vgf `Ryrz()` zhfg unir
   xvaq `Fgehpg`; ryfr jenc `ReeVainyvqGnetrg`. N avy `ybbxhc` orpbzrf `bf.YbbxhcRai`. Jnyx
   `Ryrz()` jvgu cngu `""` naq cersvk `""`. Erghea `reebef.Wbva(reef...)`, juvpu vf avy jura
   gurer ner abar.
2. Jnyx, sbe rirel svryq vaqrk `v` bs gur fgehpg glcr: fxvc harkcbegrq svryqf; ernq gur `rai`
   gnt, fxvc ba `-`; anzr = gnt be `HccreFanxr(svryq anzr)`; xrl = cersvk + anzr; cngu =
   cnerag cngu + "." + svryq anzr (ab qbg ng gur ebbg). Vs gur svryq glcr vf n fgehpg gung qbrf
   abg cnefr vgfrys: puvyq cersvk = bhgre cersvk + gur `cersvk` gnt vs `Ybbxhc` svaqf bar (rira
   rzcgl), ryfr xrl + `_` (gur xrl nyernql fgnegf jvgu gur bhgre cersvk); erphefr evtug njnl
   (gung xrrcf gur reebef va svryq beqre) naq pbagvahr. Bgurejvfr svyy gur yrns.
3. Svyy n yrns: vs gur glcr vf hafhccbegrq, erpbeq gur reebe naq fgbc (orsber nal ybbxhc).
   Ybbx hc gur xrl; vs abg frg be rzcgl, hfr gur `qrsnhyg` gnt. Fgvyy rzcgl: erpbeq
   `ReeErdhverq` vs erdhverq, ryfr yrnir gur svryq nybar. Bgurejvfr cnefr; ba snvyher erpbeq n
   `SvryqReebe` jvgu gur enj grkg nf `Inyhr` naq gur cnefre'f reebe nf `Ree`.
4. Cnefr vagb `i`: (n) `*G` vzcyrzragf `GrkgHaznefunyre`: pnyy vg ba `i.Nqqe()`. (o) `G` vf
   `gvzr.Qhengvba`: `CnefrQhengvba`, `FrgVag`. (p) Fjvgpu ba gur xvaq: cbvagre → `ersyrpg.Arj` bs
   gur ryrzrag glcr, cnefr vagb vgf `Ryrz()`, gura `i.Frg` gur arj cbvagre; fgevat; obby; gur
   vag snzvyl; gur hvag snzvyl; gur sybng snzvyl; `[]fgevat` → fcyvg, gevz, qebc rzcgl, `Frg`.
5. N `fhccbegrq(g)` shapgvba gung nafjref gur fnzr dhrfgvbaf nf fgrc 4 jvgubhg cnefvat.
6. `SvryqReebe.Reebe`: guerr pnfrf, purpxrq va guvf beqre: `Inyhr == ""`, gura `Frperg`, gura gur
   abezny bar jvgu `%d`.
7. `HccreFanxr`: pbaireg gb `[]ehar` fb lbh pna ybbx ng gur cerivbhf naq gur arkg punenpgre, naq
   jevgr vagb n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`.
